>
  <p>
    What is the Thomas archive? It is a collection of interesting resources and
    posts on the subject of my family history. It is not limited to the Thomas
    family exclusively, but I used Thomas as the name so that it would be easy
    to find for my family and friends.
  </p>

  <p>
    The archive was created because I wanted a place on the internet where my
    more interesting research, notes, and primary documents would live.
    Hopefully you will find something interesting in the archive, perhaps about
    one of our shared ancestors.
  </p>
  <p>
    The biggest project I've completed so far is a collection of excerpts from
    three books, and a collection of biographical notes about my Thomas
    ancestors in Texas, North Carolina, and Virginia. <a
      href="https://thomasarchive.com/book"
      >You can find the book compilation in this link.</a
    >
  </p>
  <p>Hope you enjoy!</p>
  <p>Sam Thomas</p>
</Layout>
